WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:05.170
Lamp for reps. Part nine: applications on the phone.

2
00:00:05.530 --> 00:00:09.160
Someone calls who isn't in your leads. Get their email first.

3
00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:14.520
On Files, under your application links, is On the phone with someone new.

4
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.790
Their email goes in first. If the call drops, you can still reach them.

5
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:25.090
Then their cell phone, first name, and business, if you have them.

6
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:37.000
Short on time? Email them the application sends them their own link, with what you typed already filled in.

7
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:42.990
Fill it in with them now opens their application in a new tab, with what you typed already in.

8
00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:47.100
The bar at the top says you're filling it in for them, on the phone.

9
00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:52.890
Skip their Social Security number and date of birth. They add those themselves, when they sign.

10
00:00:53.270 --> 00:01:01.660
They have to go? Press Email it to them to finish. What you typed is saved, and they get a link to finish it and sign.

11
00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:09.460
Get to the end together? Email them the link the same way. They check it, and sign. Never sign for them.

12
00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.890
Either way, the signed application lands in your files.

13
00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:17.180
Email first. Then fill it in, or send it.
